models.description:
Audit trail of all inventory changes.

Provides a complete, immutable history of every inventory adjustment, including reservations, allocations, returns, and corrections. This table supports forensic analysis and reconciliation.

Each transaction represents a single atomic change to inventory quantity and links to the source of that change (order, return, manual adjustment).

This table is critical for financial audit compliance and inventory reconciliation. It is append-only; records are never modified or deleted.

