Notifications for inventory threshold breaches.

Tracks alerts generated when inventory levels fall below the configured min_stock_threshold. These alerts trigger notifications to sellers and may initiate automated reorder processes.

An alert is created when inventory_units.quantity drops below min_stock_threshold and is cleared when inventory increases beyond threshold.

This table provides historical visibility into stock issues and helps identify products with recurring low inventory problems.

